OL,3,GNEWSABoy attacked after calling out
OL,4,Astreet urination
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy has been left with life-changing
OL,7,Finjuries, after being attacked by a man
OL,8,Fwho he had challenged about urinating
OL,9,Fin the street.
OL,11,FThe 14-year-old was assaulted between
OL,12,F08:30 and 08:45 BST, at the rear of
OL,13,FKensington Street in Bradford, police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe victim told police he had seen a
OL,17,Fman who he described as "tall, fat and
OL,18,Fbald with a beard", urinating in public
OL,19,Fand questioned what he was doing before
OL,20,Fbeing attacked.
